# ScaleKitchen: Complete Architectural Restructure Plan

## Executive Summary

**Current State**: Monolithic, client-to-database coupling, security in rules, no API layer, single deployment
**Target State**: Microservices-ready, API-first, token-based auth, separate deployments, enterprise-grade

**Timeline**: 12 weeks
**Team Size**: 1-2 engineers
**Risk Level**: Medium (requires careful phased migration)

---

