# Part 3: Complete API Specification

## Authentication

### POST /api/auth/login
**Owner/Manager Email+Password Login**

**Request:**
```json
{
  "email": "owner@kitchen.com",
  "password": "securePassword123",
  "role": "owner"  // or "manager"
}
```

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "user": {
    "uid": "firebase_uid",
    "email": "owner@kitchen.com",
    "name": "Kitchen Owner",
    "role": "owner",
    "businessId": "biz_xyz"
  },
  "tokens": {
    "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",      // JWT, expires in 15 min
    "refreshToken": "refresh_...",     // HttpOnly cookie, expires in 7 days
    "expiresIn": 900
  }
}
```

**Errors:**
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "INVALID_CREDENTIALS",
  "message": "Email or password is incorrect"
}
```

---

### POST /api/auth/signup
**New Owner Registration**

**Request:**
```json
{
  "email": "newowner@kitchen.com",
  "password": "securePassword123",
  "confirmPassword": "securePassword123",
  "businessName": "My Kitchen",
  "ownerName": "Owner Name",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "city": "Bangalore"
}
```

**Response (201):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "user": {
    "uid": "new_uid",
    "email": "newowner@kitchen.com",
    "businessId": "biz_new"
  },
  "message": "Account created. Verify your email to activate.",
  "tokens": {
    "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",
    "refreshToken": "refresh_..."
  }
}
```

---

### POST /api/driver/login
**Delivery Boy Phone + PIN Login**

**Request:**
```json
{
  "phone": "7702667567",
  "pin": "1234",
  "businessId": "biz_xyz"  // Optional, can auto-detect
}
```

**Response (200):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "driver": {
    "uid": "driver_biz_xyz_staff_abc",
    "name": "Suresh Kumar",
    "phone": "7702667567",
    "businessId": "biz_xyz",
    "staffId": "staff_abc",
    "branchId": "branch_1",
    "status": "Active"
  },
  "tokens": {
    "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",      // JWT with role: 'driver' claim
    "refreshToken": "refresh_...",
    "expiresIn": 86400  // 24 hours
  }
}
```

**Errors:**
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "INVALID_PIN",
  "message": "Incorrect PIN. (4 attempts remaining before lockout)",
  "attemptsRemaining": 4
}
```

